WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.734
-Good evening.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.169
I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.838
We hope you're
all doing well tonight.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.606
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:07.907
President Biden today signed the

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.476
bipartisan infrastructure
bill into law.

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.479
And I think it's good that
he's finally taking action

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:18.251
against the dilapidated
and crumbling approval rating.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.052
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:22.055
did not attend today's
signing ceremony

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.189
for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill.

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:28.528
But in another middle finger to
the Right, Big Bird did.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:32.699
Former President Trump released
a statement on Saturday

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:36.069
encouraging primary campaigns
against Republican House members

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:39.072
who voted for the bipartisan
infrastructure bill and said,

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:42.074
"Saving America starts by
saving the GOP from

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:44.944
RINOs, sellouts,
and known losers."

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:49.048
Take it from him,
all of those things.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.250
In his new book,
former New Jersey governor

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.786
Chris Christie writes
that while he was hospitalized

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:55.121
with the coronavirus,

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:58.024
former president Trump
called him to ask him,

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.826
"Are you going to say you
got it from me?"

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:05.164
Aww! That's actually --
that's actually sweet.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:08.367
Just like the card he sent when
Melania was pregnant.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:11.671
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.039
Now...

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.609
After Senator
Bernie Sanders tweeted,

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.011
"We must demand that
the extremely wealthy

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:22.148
pay their fair share,"
Tesla C.E.O. Elon Musk

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.682
replied yesterday and said,

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:27.187
"I keep forgetting
that you're still alive."

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:30.123
Wow. Well, that is one of
the side effects.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:36.095
Vice President Kamala Harris
has reportedly told confidants

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:38.197
that she feels constrained
with what

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:40.966
she is able to do, politically,
in the Biden administration.

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.403
"Same," said Biden.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:48.775
On a new episode of his podcast,
Joe Rogan said

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.344
that he's so flexible, he is
capable of performing oral sex

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:57.217
on himself, or, as he calls it,
"Doing my own research."

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:04.190
And, finally, Buckingham Palace
announced yesterday

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.025
that Britain's Queen Elizabeth
skipped a

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.829
Remembrance Day Ceremony
due to a sprained back muscle.

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.764
Apparently,
she heard that Rogan story

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.133
and wanted to give it a shot.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.936
Picture it.
Picture it.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.011
That was the monologue.

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.579
I mean,
we're not doing another one.

